{"id":"n24434-1-2","stage":5,"title":"다다익선 · 多多益善","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24434-1-2-1","ko":"바구니에 사과를 얼마나 담아 줄까?","zh":"要往篮子里放多少个苹果呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바구니에","meaning":"篮子，篮，筐","explanation":"바구니：篮子，篮，筐；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바구니","audio":"/audio/aefd79ef32fe1aa93eff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15797","senseId":"1","lemma":"바구니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사과를","meaning":"苹果","explanation":"사과：苹果；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사과","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66371","senseId":"1","lemma":"사과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"담아","meaning":"装，盛","explanation":"담다：装，盛；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"담다","audio":"/audio/41232b29db6bd744f882.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73283","senseId":"1","lemma":"담다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄까?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aefd79ef32fe1aa9","term":"바구니","zh":"篮子，篮，筐","audio":"/audio/aefd79ef32fe1aa93eff.mp3","entryId":"15797","definition":"用竹子、塑料等材料编织而成的内部空间较深的容器。","pronunciation":["바구니"]},{"id":"46fc35121d1a4b33","term":"사과","zh":"苹果","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3","entryId":"66371","definition":"圆而红、味道酸甜的水果。","pronunciation":["사과"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"达到某个程度地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"41232b29db6bd744","term":"담다","zh":"装，盛","audio":"/audio/41232b29db6bd744f882.mp3","entryId":"73283","definition":"把某物装进器皿里等。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4ee0826a06fa80df53ec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24434-1-2-2","ko":"다다익선이니 많으면 많을수록 좋지요.","zh":"越多越好，数量越多越理想。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다다익선이니","meaning":"多多益善","explanation":"다다익선：多多益善；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"다다익선","audio":"/audio/e32491f9267d3e8d5247.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24434","senseId":"1","lemma":"다다익선","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많으면","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많을수록","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；을수록：表示程度随之变化：“越……越……”。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋지요.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e32491f9267d3e8d","term":"다다익선","zh":"多多益善","audio":"/audio/e32491f9267d3e8d5247.mp3","entryId":"24434","definition":"越多越好。","pronunciation":["다다익썬"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或